      <div class="ba-title">Before → After Preview</div>
      <div class="ba-row">
        <div class="ba-item">
          <span class="label">BEFORE</span>
          <img src="https://assets.cdn.filesafe.space/SE5erRrSgZF2j1lHjHt0/media/a58c23f7-6c5f-405f-b101-84f73b22c704.png" alt="Before">
        </div>
        <div class="ba-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="ba-item after">
          <span class="label">AFTER</span>
          <img src="https://assets.cdn.filesafe.space/SE5erRrSgZF2j1lHjHt0/media/1c63c0f7-8e0c-48c4-a2bf-4ff4552383dd.png" alt="After">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- THE PROBLEM -->
<section class="problem" id="work">
  <div class="section">
    <span class="kicker">The Problem</span>
    <h2>WHY MOST SOCIAL MEDIA<br>DOESN'T WORK.</h2>
    <p class="muted">Most businesses don't fail at social media because of effort. They fail because there's no system behind the effort.</p>
    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="p-card">
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <h3>No Clear Strategy</h3>
        <p>Posting without a plan means every post starts from zero.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-card">
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <h3>Content Gets Ignored</h3>
        <p>Good content with weak hooks and positioning never gets seen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-card">
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <h3>Inconsistent Posting</h3>
        <p>Random bursts of activity don't build momentum or trust.</p>
      </div>
